# shell: desktop
# DB-009: dragging a file onto the Deskbar leaf makes a link there, not a
# copy -- the bar is a set of pointers at things.
note drag a.txt from the window onto the Deskbar logo
press 200 136
move 300 90
move 930 20
release 930 20
wait 25
note the link is there and the original is untouched -- a link, not a copy
expect-file /home/ambuj/.config/deskbar/a.txt
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/a.txt
note and removing the source leaves it dangling, which a copy would not
quit
